  "revision_scope": {
    "whole_article_rewritten": true,
    "sections": [
      "Abstract and introduction",
      "Definitions and notation",
      "Common feasibility and duality statements",
      "Finite-volume weights and all higher dimensions",
      "Squared projection norms and normalization",
      "Compact configurations and local inequalities",
      "Arithmetic hypotheses and finite classifications",
      "Exact verification and reproduction"
    ],
    "main_corrections": [
      "Dimension bounds are conclusions; feasibility problems encode necessary conditions for polytopes.",
      "Planar angles and weights replace unexplained charges/payments/budgets.",
      "The variables are squared norms of projections, not projection vectors.",
      "Connected components of the vertex diagram span tangent subspaces; the tangent space itself has no spherical components.",
      "Facet normals, opposite facets, exceptional configurations and their supports are defined.",
      "Full vertex diagrams, finite endpoint contacts and algebraic classifications are stated explicitly.",
      "Source hypotheses, auxiliary-facet checks, all corners and same-vector conditions remain explicit.",
      "Duplicated workflow promises and undefined proof nicknames removed."
    ],
    "additional_explicit_information": "The two cubic fields and finite endpoint angles in the A17 local classification are named from the already cited companion proof; no new dimension estimate is asserted."
